<div data-tabs><div class="ac-tabs"><button class="ac-tab active" type="button" data-tab-target="general">General</button><button class="ac-tab" type="button" data-tab-target="commerce">Commerce</button><button class="ac-tab" type="button" data-tab-target="delivery">Delivery & returns</button><button class="ac-tab" type="button" data-tab-target="sustainability">Sustainability</button><button class="ac-tab" type="button" data-tab-target="security">Security</button><button class="ac-tab" type="button" data-tab-target="notifications">Notifications</button><button class="ac-tab" type="button" data-tab-target="maintenance">Maintenance</button></div><section data-tab-panel="general"><form class="ac-card" data-admin-form="general-settings"><div class="ac-head"><h2>Platform configuration</h2></div><div class="ac-body"><div class="ac-form-grid"><div class="ac-field"><label for="platform-name">Platform name *</label><input class="ac-input" id="platform-name" name="platform_name" required value="Conscious Indi"></div><div class="ac-field"><label for="support-email">Support email *</label><input class="ac-input" id="support-email" name="support_email" type="email" required></div><div class="ac-field"><label for="currency">Currency</label><select class="ac-select" id="currency" name="currency"><option>INR (₹)</option></select></div><div class="ac-field"><label for="timezone">Time zone</label><select class="ac-select" id="timezone" name="timezone"><option>Asia/Kolkata</option></select></div><div class="ac-field full"><label for="legal-name">Legal platform entity *</label><input class="ac-input" id="legal-name" name="legal_entity" required></div></div><div class="ac-form-actions"><button class="ac-btn primary" type="submit">Validate settings</button></div></div></form></section><section data-tab-panel="commerce" hidden><form class="ac-card" data-admin-form="commerce-settings"><div class="ac-body"><div class="ac-form-grid"><div class="ac-field"><label for="default-commission">Default commission (%) *</label><input class="ac-input" id="default-commission" name="commission" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" required></div><div class="ac-field"><label for="minimum-payout">Minimum payout (₹) *</label><input class="ac-input" id="minimum-payout" name="minimum_payout" type="number" min="0" required></div><div class="ac-field"><label for="settlement-hold">Settlement/return hold (days) *</label><input class="ac-input" id="settlement-hold" name="hold_days" type="number" min="0" max="365" required></div><div class="ac-field"><label for="order-acceptance">Vendor acceptance SLA (hours) *</label><input class="ac-input" id="order-acceptance" name="acceptance_sla" type="number" min="1" max="168" required></div></div><div class="ac-form-actions"><button class="ac-btn primary" type="submit">Validate commerce settings</button></div></div></form></section><section data-tab-panel="delivery" hidden class="ac-card"><div class="ac-body"><p>Manual vendor delivery status vocabulary, attempt limits, proof requirements, COD reconciliation, RTO rules, customer notification templates, default return window and policy-exception authorization.</p><button class="ac-btn primary" type="button" data-demo-action="Open delivery and return policy editor">Configure</button></div></section><section data-tab-panel="sustainability" hidden class="ac-card"><div class="ac-body"><h2>Claims governance</h2><p>Allowed claim types, evidence requirements, certificate issuers, expiry reminders, review SLA, automatic public withdrawal and methodology versions.</p><div class="ac-callout warning">Carbon-neutral, avoided-emissions and similar claims require defined boundaries and specialized review; they are not simple vendor checkboxes.</div><button class="ac-btn primary mt-3" type="button" data-demo-action="Open sustainability claim rules">Configure</button></div></section><section data-tab-panel="security" hidden class="ac-card"><div class="ac-body"><p>MFA policy · session expiry · password policy · rate limits · sensitive-data masking · export approvals · maker/checker · break-glass access · retention.</p><button class="ac-btn danger" type="button" data-demo-action="Review security policy changes with step-up authentication">Review changes</button></div></section><section data-tab-panel="notifications" hidden class="ac-card"><div class="ac-body">Transactional templates, channels, consent, retry, suppression, delivery results and localization.</div></section><section data-tab-panel="maintenance" hidden class="ac-card"><div class="ac-body"><div class="ac-callout warning">Maintenance, feature flags and emergency stops require backend authorization, confirmation and immutable audit.</div><div class="ac-actions mt-3"><button class="ac-btn" type="button" data-demo-action="Review storefront maintenance mode">Maintenance mode</button><button class="ac-btn danger" type="button" data-demo-action="Review emergency order stop">Emergency order stop</button></div></div></section></div>
